{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "624a06cf-ed2c-48ae-8fa2-5a237c6c7428",
      "name": "Topics",
      "description": {
        "content": "A **Topic** is a way of labeling a conversation in Gladly for specific business purposes. For example, an agent may apply the topic \"Return\" to a conversation where a customer returns merchandise.\nTopics are used for reporting and to control various workflows.\n\nTopics can be configured to have a nested hierarchy. For instance, the topic \"Return\" could be a parent of \"Size\" and \"Color\" child topics. Visit our [Help Pages](https://help.gladly.com/docs/principles-of-hierarchical-topics) to learn more about Hierarchical Topics.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
